<section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="hero-badge">
            <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
            AI-Powered Job Matching
        </div>
        <h1>
            Your Skills Deserve<br>
            the <span class="hl">Right Opportunity</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">
            Tell our AI what you're good at and what you're looking for.
            We match freshers and job seekers with roles that actually fit —
            no more endless scrolling through irrelevant listings.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18"/></svg>
                App for Employees
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="features">
    <div class="sec-header">
        <h2>Why <span class="hl">JOBCARE</span></h2>
        <p>Built for freshers and job seekers who deserve better than black-hole applications.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-grid section-center">
        <div class="feature-card glass">
            <div class="feature-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 1a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v8a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V4a3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"/><path d="M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2"/><line x1="12" y1="19" x2="12" y2="23"/><line x1="8" y1="23" x2="16" y2="23"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Voice-First Search</h3>
            <p>Skip the forms. Speak naturally about your skills and goals — our AI understands you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card glass">
            <div class="feature-icon cyan">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 10 10H12V2z"/><path d="M20.66 8A10 10 0 0 0 14 2v6h6.66z" opacity="0.5"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Smart Matching</h3>
            <p>Goes beyond keywords. Our AI understands context, intent, and your actual career trajectory.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card glass">
            <div class="feature-icon green">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Verified Outcomes</h3>
            <p>Higher response rates, better matches. We measure success, not just applications sent.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-sm" id="how">
    <div class="sec-header">
        <h2>How It <span class="hl">Works</span></h2>
        <p>Three steps between you and your next role.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps-row">
        <div class="step-card glass">
            <div class="step-num">1</div>
            <h3>Create Your Profile</h3>
            <p>Tell us your skills, experience, and what kind of role you're after.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card glass">
            <div class="step-num">2</div>
            <h3>Speak to AI</h3>
            <p>Use your voice to describe your ideal job. Our AI listens and learns.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card glass">
            <div class="step-num">3</div>
            <h3>Get Matched</h3>
            <p>Receive curated matches ranked by fit. Apply where it actually matters.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

